Dependencies and their licences
-------------------------------
skpwright 0.6.1 (GPL-3.0-only), https://github.com/hew3d/skpwright
  The clean-room .skp reader and writer. Its test corpus is fetched, never
  copied into this repository, by commit and sha256 (tools/ci/fetch-fixtures.sh).
  The corpus is GPL-3.0-only except for third-party content embedded in the
  .skp files (Trimble Content textures and the default template's scale-figure
  component), which stays the property of its owners.

rvt-open (Apache-2.0), https://github.com/helenkwok/rvt-open
  Reads .rvt and writes IFC4, IFCX, glTF, OBJ, USD, Fragments and DXF. Used as a
  git dependency pinned to a commit. rvt-open does not depend on skp-open. It
  carries its own NOTICE, with the credits of the work it derives from.

earcut 0.4.12 (MIT OR Apache-2.0), https://github.com/georust/earcut
anyhow 1.0.104 (MIT OR Apache-2.0)
serde_json 1.0.154 (MIT OR Apache-2.0), tests only
  And the crates these pull in; `cargo tree` lists them, and Cargo.lock pins them.

